docs/debate/codex_r5.log:208:| **AI Skin Analysis** | `skin-analysis` | **~12 units/call** (1–2 concerns), **22 units** for all 16 SD concerns; the cost scales with concern count | `dst_actions` array; SD and HD **cannot be mixed**. SD concerns: wrinkle, droopy_upper_eyelid, droopy_lower_eyelid, firmness, acne, moisture, eye_bag, dark_circle_v2, age_spot, radiance, redness, oiliness, pore, texture, tear_trough, skin_type. HD keys carry an `hd_` prefix (confirm exact action names). `"format":"json"`. Output per concern: `ui_score` (int 1–100, adjusted to motivate the user), `raw_score` (float), `mask_urls`. `miniserver_args.enable_mask_overlay` returns one blended image. Image: jpg/png under 10 MB, short side ≥480 px for SD and ≥1080 px for HD, **face width over 60% of the image**, portrait, no glasses, forehead visible, good light. → The UI needs a selfie-framing guide. |
