docs/debate/codex_r3.log:379:**Judge / demo mode:** a pre-rendered persona (all steps cached once) so judges can click through until Nov 20 without spending units.
docs/debate/codex_r3.log:384:1. **Chaining (step 7 → 8):** can Makeup VTO run on the *clothes VTO output*? In a full-body image the face may be under Makeup VTO's
